  "facts": [
    "Sandnessund Bridge, a 1,220‑metre cantilever marvel, opened to traffic on 21 December 1973, with Crown Prince Harald officially inaugurating it on 26 June 1974.",
    "Its 36 concrete spans include a 150‑metre main span, while the 41‑metre clearance below lets sizable vessels glide beneath the Tromsø skyline.",
    "Built for 36 million kr, the bridge was a toll road until 1 May 1982, after which it became free for all commuters."
